"id":"c-shiji-058-liang:p010","text":"上怒稍解，因上書請朝。既至關，茅蘭說王，使乘布車，從兩騎入，匿於長公主園。漢使使迎王，王已入關，車騎盡居外，不知王處。太后泣曰：「帝殺吾子！」景帝憂恐。於是梁王伏斧質於闕下，謝罪，然後太后、景帝大喜，相泣，復如故。悉召王從官入關。然景帝益疏王，不同車輦矣。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-058-liang:m010-0000","start":0,"end":1,"surface":"上","kind":"person","person_id":"82d_8vl_8i1_B","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-058-liang:m010-0015","start":15,"end":17,"surface":"茅蘭","kind":"person","person_id":"7ge_psz_ic9","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-058-liang:m010-0018","start":18,"end":19,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"82d_8vl_8i1_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-058-liang:m010-0026","start":26,"end":28,"surface":"兩騎","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"匿名者、群體、制度泛稱、所舉古事或未定指代；不補來源未見姓名、成員及關係。"},{"id":"c-shiji-058-liang:m010-0032","start":32,"end":35,"surface":"長公主","kind":"person","person_id":"kvm_6zv_6ez","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-058-liang:m010-0041","start":41,"end":42,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"82d_8vl_8i1_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-058-liang:m010-0043","start":43,"end":44,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"82d_8vl_8i1_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-058-liang:m010-0056","start":56,"end":57,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"82d_8vl_8i1_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-058-liang:m010-0059","start":59,"end":61,"surface":"太后","kind":"person","person_id":"tjk_5e2_wse","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-058-liang:m010-0065","start":65,"end":66,"surface":"帝","kind":"person","person_id":"82d_8vl_8i1_B","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-058-liang:m010-0071","start":71,"end":73,"surface":"景帝","kind":"person","person_id":"82d_8vl_8i1_B","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-058-liang:m010-0078","start":78,"end":80,"surface":"梁王","kin